{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm + Dating Sim. You play as a new student in Concordia Academy of Music, facing a crisis on your first day joining the Cajon Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music dueling</strong> <br>Boss fights are reimagined as live music showdowns. Use your ears to dissect the opponent's patterns, then replicate and dominate the groove. (Music school veterans will recognize this twist on audition-style rhythm dictation!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jamming with your partners</strong> <br>Team up for real-time jam sessions: 4-player sync on PC. Not mirrored charts - actual split-score teamwork where every part matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with a real cajon</strong><br>Crush beats using actual acoustic cajons. We've cracked the code for 100% authentic playing feel - no specialty gear required. Works with most standard cajons right out of the box.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693720?t=1765260199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/388a752802500ec2b6e4e9ddb7629a46665aae19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765260199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/18f7424ea4f053d06fa80305e722979002de2b27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765260199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/18f7424ea4f053d06fa80305e722979002de2b27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765260199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":3